<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:#f3f6fa;padding:24px;" width="100%">
	
		<tr>
			<td align="center">
			<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:620px;max-width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dce4ed;" width="620">
				
					<tr>
						<td style="background-color:#1c3553;height:10px;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:28px 28px 16px 28px;color:#242424;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;">Hi Team,<br />
						<br />
						The <strong>SPC Final Milestone</strong> for product project <a href="{{{Milestone__c.TECH_ProjectLink__c}}}" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#285b87;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;">{{{Milestone__c.TECH_ProjectName__c}}}</a> has officially been <strong>validated</strong> in Salesforce.<br />
						<br />
						You can now <strong>contribute</strong> to the Engineering phase of the project and continue to review and complete your assigned tasks.</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="background-color:#1c3553;padding:16px 28px;">
						<div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.5px;color:#ffffff;">KEY INFO</div>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:16px 28px 24px 28px;">
						<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-size:14px;color:#242424;" width="100%">
							
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:13px 10px 13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf0;color:#526579;font-weight:bold;" valign="top" width="185">Type of project :</td>
									<td style="padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf0;line-height:21px;" valign="top"><strong>{_PMTProjectType_}</strong></td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:13px 10px 13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf0;color:#526579;font-weight:bold;" valign="top">Estimated Launch Date :</td>
									<td style="padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf0;line-height:21px;" valign="top"><strong>{_PMTLaunchDate_}</strong></td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:13px 10px 13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf0;color:#526579;font-weight:bold;" valign="top">SPC Validation Date :</td>
									<td style="padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf0;line-height:21px;" valign="top"><strong>{_MilestoneStartDate_}</strong></td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:13px 10px 13px 0;color:#526579;font-weight:bold;" valign="top">Project Description :</td>
									<td style="padding:13px 0;line-height:21px;" valign="top"><strong>{_PMTProjectDescription_}</strong></td>
								</tr>
							
						</table>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:4px 28px 30px 28px;">
						<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
							
								<tr>
									<td bgcolor="#1c3553" style="background-color:#1c3553;"><a href="{{{Milestone__c.TECH_ProjectLink__c}}}" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 22px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;">ACCESS THE PROJECT IN SALESFORE </a></td>
								</tr>
							
						</table>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="background-color:#edf3f8;padding:20px 28px;color:#242424;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;">If you have any questions or require support, feel free to reach out to the <strong>Product Strategy Team</strong>.</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="border-top:1px solid #dce4ed;padding:20px 28px 24px 28px;color:#526579;font-size:13px;line-height:21px;">Thank you,<br />
						<br />
						<strong style="color:#1c3553;">The Product Strategy Team</strong></td>
					</tr>
				
			</table>
			</td>
		</tr>
	
</table>
</body>
</html>